abstract: >-
  Research repository for predictive processing, mentalization, the world tree,
  dynamic golden-bias regulation, rhythm evidence, knowledge forests,
  preassessment, language evidence, reference model code and reproducible
  experiments. The runnable product implementation is maintained in a separate
  Tender-Product repository.
